 |---|---|---|
 | `provider` | — | Provider route for every session's agent |
 | `model` | — | Model for every session's agent |
+| `streamText` | `false` | Forward transient text before message completion; a failed prompt may leave a visible prefix |
+| `publicReplyJson` | `false` | Decode a paired public-output producer's canonical JSON for ACP display while retaining it in model history |
